{
"A great state is hard to fathom; I feared an ambush.": "5141dce3af94",
"He asked: On what will you fight?": "c246c8595410",
"He replied: A small good faith that has not yet won trust. The spirits will not bless you for it.": "f40338017e2d",
"He replied: A small kindness that does not reach everyone. The people will not follow you for it.": "3b53cf0e8407",
"He replied: Battle is a matter of spirit. The first roll of the drum rouses it; the second lets it slacken; the third exhausts it.": "5230db3b5913",
"He replied: That belongs to doing your utmost for the people. On this you may fight. And when you fight, let me come with you.": "36f73aec16ae",
"His fellow villagers said: The meat-eaters will plan it. What part have you in it?": "c5e66412e445",
"I saw that their wheel tracks were confused and their banners were down, and so I gave chase.": "6a214648967c",
"In the spring of the tenth year, the army of Ch'i attacked us. The Duke was about to give battle, and Ts'ao Kuei asked for an audience.": "d40206fae01a",
"Kuei said: The meat-eaters are shortsighted; they cannot plan far ahead. And he went in to see the Duke.": "16f21cd80442",
"The Duke said: In lawsuits great and small, though I cannot examine them all, I always judge by the facts.": "a7359affd514",
"The Duke said: In the victims and the jade and silk of sacrifice, I have never dared overstate; I always report truly.": "d804f06d8346",
"The Duke said: What clothing and food give me ease, I have never dared keep to myself; I always share them out.": "26e7d7e23344",
"The Duke took him in his chariot, and they fought at Ch'ang-shao.": "0d8a45a69a1f",
"The Duke was about to beat the drum for the charge. Kuei said: Not yet. The men of Ch'i drummed three times. Kuei said: Now. The army of Ch'i was routed.": "d2bade745dad",
"The Duke was about to give chase. Kuei said: Not yet. He got down and looked at their wheel tracks, climbed onto the crossbar and looked after them, and said: Now. So they pursued the army of Ch'i.": "fd93aed47c5c",
"Theirs was spent and ours was full: that is why we overcame them.": "f0d194eaab31",
"When the victory was won, the Duke asked him the reason.": "d447862b8736"
